<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Pula Guide: 12 places – arena, sunsets, Brijuni, Rovinj &amp; Istria’s hinterland – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/pula/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Pula Arena</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · In the evening the arena is lit up – come at sunset and see the light afterwards. In summer there are concerts. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/pula/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>13.8313,44.84745,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Forum &amp; Temple of Augustus</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/pula/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>13.84184,44.87018,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Zerostrasse tunnels &amp; citadel</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · The info boards cover a lot of city history including trams – take it as a cool break rather than a museum. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/pula/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>13.84568,44.87032,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Market hall (Tržnica)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/pula/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>13.84958,44.8668,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Verudela</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Bring water shoes. Come for sunset – and wear sturdy shoes for the rocks. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/pula/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>13.83509,44.83735,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Fort Bourguignon</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · A place for the curious; watch your footing and do not enter closed-off areas. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/pula/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>13.83352,44.84707,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Cape Kamenjak</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Pack water shoes and a parasol – there is little shade. Come early and explore by bike. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/pula/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>13.91151,44.78198,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Brijuni Islands</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Plan a full day and book the boat beforehand. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/pula/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>13.75203,44.91343,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>12. Rovinj – old town by the sea</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Climb to the church for the view. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/pula/#o12</description><Point><coordinates>13.63435,45.08258,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
